:: Park

<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $bus to "park">><<getTarget true>>
You are in the park.
<<if Time.dayState is "dawn">>
	There are a few people out walking or jogging. Some have dogs with them.
<<elseif Time.dayState is "day">>
	<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
		Very few people are out, walking around the puddles that dot the paths.
	<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
		Many people are out, walking their dogs or jogging, wrapped up warm against the cold.
	<<else>>
		Many people are out, walking their dogs or jogging. You hear children in the playground.
	<</if>>
<<elseif Time.dayState is "dusk">>
	There are many people around. Students hang out near the playground.
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<if $park_fame gte 60>>
		<span class="pink">Creepy figures lurk in the shadows.</span> <i>News of your lewd running has spread. Don't run while exposed for several days if you want it to cool off.</i>
	<<elseif $park_fame gte 20>>
		<span class="pink">You think you're being watched.</span> <i>News of your lewd running has spread. Don't run while exposed for a few days if you want it to cool off.</i>
	<<elseif Weather.bloodMoon && !Weather.isOvercast>>
		The blood moon shines through the tree leaves.
	<<else>>
		There is no one around.
	<</if>>
<</if>>

Tulips grow in great patches near the riverbank.

<<if $halloween>>
	Halloween decorations and orange lights hang from the trees.
<</if>>

<<streeteffects>>
<br><br>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<exhibitionism "park">>
	<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		You can hear the commotion of High Street. There's no way you'll be able to cross like this. However, there's a depot from which crates are being carried across the road. Maybe you could hide in one of them.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
	<<orgasmstreet>>
<</if>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<passoutpark>>
<<else>>
	<<run statusCheck("Robin")>>

	<<if ($halloween_kylar is 1 or C.npc.Kylar.love gte 60) and $halloween_kylar_proposed isnot 1 and Time.dayState is "night" and C.npc.Kylar.init is 1 and C.npc.Kylar.state is "active" and (($halloween is 1 and Time.monthDay is 31 and Time.hour gte 21) or (Time.monthName is "November" and Time.monthDay is 1 and Time.hour lte 6)) and !$possessed>>
		<<halloweenkylar>>
	<<elseif (dangerEvent() or $eventforced) and $eventskip is 0>>
		<<eventsstreet>>
	<<elseif $robinReunionScene isnot undefined and _robin_location is "park" and $exposed lte 0 and !$possessed>>
		<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
		<<if $robinReunionScene is "dungeon">>
			<<wearProp "hot cocoa">>
			<<unset $robinReunionScene>><<set $robinPostMortem to true>>
			You see Robin stood behind <<his>> hot chocolate stand. <<His>> mouth falls agape as <<he>> sees you, and <<he>> sprints towards you.
			<br><br>

			"I don't believe it!" <<he>> squeals as <<he>> buries <<himself>> in your chest. "I-I thought you were gone forever! We need to talk about this at home. When you're ready."
			<br><br>

			You're led back to <<his>> stand. A small picture of the two of you sits on top. <<He>> puts it away.
			<br>
			<<He>> fixes you a cup of hot chocolate and sends you on your way.
			<br>
			"Don't forget to see me later," <<he>> says with a worried expression. "I'm always here for you if you need to talk."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $robinReunionScene is "dungeonRobin">>
			<<unset $robinReunionScene>>
			<<wearProp "hot cocoa">>
			You see Robin stood behind <<his>> hot chocolate stand. <<His>> mouth goes falls as <<he>> sees you, and <<he>> sprints towards you.
			<br><br>

			"You made it out!" <<he>> squeals as <<he>> buries <<himself>> in your chest. "When you were recaptured, I didn't know what I was going to do."
			<br><br>

			You're led back to <<his>> stand. A small picture of the two of you sits on top. <<He>> puts it away.
			<br>
			<<He>> fixes you a cup of hot chocolate and sends you on your way.
			<br>
			"Don't forget to see me later," <<he>> says with a worried expression. "I'm always here for you, never forget that."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $robinReunionScene is "asylum">>
			<<unset $robinReunionScene>>
			You see Robin stood behind <<his>> hot chocolate stand.

			<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
				<<He>> stares at you in disbelief.
				<br><br>

				"Hi," <<he>> says quietly as you draw close. "I thought the doctors took you away. I would've tried to get you something had I known you were c-coming back," Robin's voice quivers.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> excitedly beckons you over when <<he>> sees you.
				<br><br>

				"Hey, you're out!" <<he>> says as you draw close. "I thought you were staying at the doctor's for a while. I would've prepared something had I known you were coming back," Robin explains.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			You shake your head, telling <<him>> that they weren't going to help you, so you "checked" out early. Robin seems confused, but <<he>> nods regardless. <<He>> gives you a hug.
			<br>

			<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
				"Well, I'm glad you're free," <<he>> mumbles, holding you tight.
			<<else>>
				"Well, I'm happy to see you again! I hope you're feeling better."
			<</if>>
			<br>
			The two of you make small talk for a bit. Eventually, Robin says <<he>> needs to get back to <<his>> stand.

			<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
				<<He>> slowly shuffles away, <<his>> gaze glued to the floor.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> smiles and waves goodbye.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			You spot Robin at <<his>> hot chocolate stand. <<His>> eyes pass over you momentarily, but <<he>> doesn't stare. It's as if <<he>> doesn't even recognise you.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif C.npc.Robin.init is 0 and Time.season is "winter" and Time.isWeekEnd() and between(Time.hour, 9, 16) and $exposed lte 0 and !$possessed>>
		<<set $robindebt to 0>><<set $robindebtlimit to 5>>
		<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
		You see someone familiar working at a stand in the park. <<He>> notices you at the same time. "Hey!" It's Robin. <<Hes>> another resident at the orphanage. <<Hes>> always looked up to you, despite being about the same age. <<He>> motions you over, while cleaning a mug. <<He>> puts it down and hugs you when you approach.
		<br><br>

		"I haven't seen you at the orphanage in a while. We must keep missing each other. Remember, <span class="gold">you can visit me in my room at home</span> anytime you want. I've been waiting to show you something, I'm so excited!" <<He>> looks behind you, noticing customers approaching. "I've got to get back to work here. You're welcome to stay and help if you want." <<He>> gets back into position behind the stand.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif _robin_location is "park" and $exposed lte 0 and $balloonStand.open is true and $balloonStand.robin.status is "unaffected">>
		<<balloonRobinIntro>>
	<<elseif isInPark("doren") and $dorenintro is 1 and $weekly.dorenparkmeet isnot true and C.npc.Doren.love gte 50 and $loft_known is 1 and $loft_doren isnot 1>>
		<<set $weekly.dorenparkmeet to true>>
		<<npc "Doren">><<person1>>
		You spot Doren setting up a little library on the lawn. It's made from a dollhouse, its attic a miniature library. The post is cemented down in a flower-filled planter.
		<br><br>
		<<He>> greets you with a smile. "<<Lassie>>! Good <<= Time.hour lt 12 ? `morning` : `afternoon`>>. A few volunteers and I recently ran a book drive, and built this little library. I'm quite proud of it." <<He>> rests <<his>> hands on <<his>> waist with a grin.
		<br><br>
		<<if $loft_known is 1 and $loft_doren isnot 1 and C.npc.Doren.love gte 50>>
			<<lofticon>><<link [[Tell Doren about the orphanage loft|Doren Loft]]>><</link>><<set $phase to 1>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Doren Loft 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $phase2 to 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif isInPark("sam") and $Sam_Park_Intro isnot 1 and $exposed lte 0>>
		<<set $Sam_Park_Intro to 1>>
		<<npc "Sam">><<person1>>
		A duck waddles in front of you. It looks up at you, as if expecting something. Before you can react, a hand appears, holding a handful of corn.
		<br><br>
		"Give it some of this."	
		<br><br>
		<i>It's Sam.</i>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Feed the duck|Sam Park Intro]]>><<set $phase to "feed">> <</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Greet Sam|Sam Park Intro]]>><<set $phase to "greet">><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $options.mapTop is true>>
			<<map "park">>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		Places of interest
		<br>
		<<if $exposed lte 0>>
			<<if $scienceproject is "ongoing" and $sciencelichenknown is 1 and $sciencelichenpark is 0>>
				<<scienceicon "white lichen">><<link [[Examine lichen for science project|Park Lichen]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if !$plants_known.includes("tulip")>>
				<<if $sciencetrait gte 1>>
					<<foodstufficon "tulip">> <<link [[Search for seeds (0:30)|Park Tulip]]>><<set $plants_known.push("tulip")>><<pass 30>><<tending 6>><</link>><<gtending>>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">A higher science skill would let you harvest tulip seeds.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
				<span class="red">Both of your arms are bound</span>, so you are unable to pick tulips.
			<<else>>
				<<foodstufficon "tulip">> <<link [[Pick tulips (0:20)|Park Tulip Pick]]>><<pass 20>><<crimeUp 20 "petty">><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 200>><<crime "petty">>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<if _robin_location is "park">>
				<!-- if robin met, is not missing, trauma < 80%, on winter sundays 09:00 - 16:59 -->
				<<robinicon "cocoa">><<link [[Robin's hot chocolate stand|Robin Chocolate]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>
			<<if _kylarLocation.area is "park">>
				<<if _kylarLocation.state is "fountain">>
					<br>
					Kylar sits at the fountain, occasionally tossing coins in.
					<br>
					<<parkicon "fountain">><<link [[Approach|Kylar Park]]>><<set $kylar_text_trigger to true>><</link>>
				<<else>>
					<br>
					Kylar sits on a bench, sketching something.
					<br>
					<<parkicon>><<link [[Approach|Kylar Park]]>><<set $kylar_text_trigger to true>><</link>>
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
			<<if isInPark("whitney")>>
				<br>
				You see smoke trailing from beneath an umbrella. It's Whitney. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stands under a tree near the park's fountain.
				<br>
				<<parkicon "fountain">><<link [[Approach|Whitney Park]]>><<set $daily.whitney.textTrigger to true>><<if $daily.whitney.text is undefined>><<set $daily.whitney.text to 0>><<else>><<set $daily.whitney.text += 1>><</if>><</link>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
			<<if isInPark("sam") and $Sam_Park_Intro is 1>>
				You see Sam standing beside the bridge.
				<br>
				<<parkicon "bridge">><<link [[Walk over to <<nnpc_him "Sam">>|Sam Park]]>><</link>>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $halloween is 1 and Time.monthDay is 30 and Time.hour gte 6 and !$halloween_pumpkin_competition>>
			Tables have been set up, and a crowd gathers for the pumpkin carving competition.
			<br>
			<<icon "pumpkin-carving.png">><<link [[Compete (1:00)|Park Pumpkin Competition]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $halloween is 1 and Time.monthDay is 31 or $halloween_pumpkin_competition>>
			Bits of pumpkin litter the grass, and jack-o'-lanterns hang from branches.
			<<if $halloween_pumpkin_competition is "won">>
				A spooky shrine has been set up to display the winning pumpkin. <span class="green">Yours.</span>
			<<elseif $halloween_pumpkin_competition is "kylar">>
				A spooky shrine has been set up to display the winning pumpkin. <span class="green">Kylar's.</span>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<elseif $halloween is 1 and Time.monthDay is 30>>
			Tables are being set up ready for the pumpkin carving competition.
			<br>
		<<elseif $halloween and Time.dayState isnot "night">>
			Tables have been set up, where people practise pumpkin carving. A sign advertises a competition on the 30th of the month.
			<br>
			<<if $exposed lte 0>>
				<<icon "pumpkin-carving.png">><<link [[Pumpkin carving|Park Pumpkin]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<span class="blue">You'll need to dress decently before taking part in pumpkin carving.</span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<icon "men-toilet.png">><<link [[Men's toilets (0:01)|Men's Toilets]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<icon "women-toilet.png">><<link [[Women's toilets (0:01)|Women's Toilets]]>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<if $leftleg is "bound" or $rightleg is "bound">>
			<<set $_boundType to ($leftleg is "bound" ? ($rightleg is "bound" ? "both legs" : "your left leg") : "your right leg")>>
			You cannot go for a run with $_boundType bound.
			<br>
		<<elseif $worn.feet.type.includes("shackle")>>
			You cannot go for a run while shackled.
			<br>
		<<elseif $worn.feet.type.includes("heels") and ($exposed is 0 or Time.dayState is "night")>>
			<<heelsicon>><<link [[Exercise in heels (0:30)|Park Exercise Heels]]>><<athletics 3>><<pass 30>><<tiredness 4>><<stress -1>><<slimeEventEnd "running">><</link>><<ggtiredness>><<gathletics>><<lstress>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
				<<if $exposed gte 2 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
					<<runicon>><<link [[Go for a run (0:30)|Park Run Exposed]]>><<athletics 4>><<set $phase to 0>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -3>><<slimeEventEnd "running">><</link>><<exhibitionist3>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>><<lstress>>
					<br>
				<<elseif $exposed is 1>>
					<<runicon>><<link [[Go for a run (0:30)|Park Run Exposed]]>><<athletics 4>><<set $phase to 1>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -3>><<slimeEventEnd "running">><</link>><<exhibitionist1>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>><<lstress>>
					<br>
				<<elseif $exposed is 0>>
					<<runicon>><<link [[Go for a run (0:30)|Park Run]]>><<athletics 4>><<pass 30>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -3>><<slimeEventEnd "running">><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>><<lstress>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<<elseif $exposed is 0>>
				<<runicon>><<link [[Go for a run (0:30)|Park Run]]>><<athletics 4>><<pass 30>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -3>><<slimeEventEnd "running">><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gathletics>><<lstress>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if (Weather.precipitation is "none" or $worn.handheld.type.includes("rainproof"))>>
			<<if $milkshake gte 1 and $exposed lte 0>>
				<<foodicon "milkshake">><<link [[Drink your milkshake (0:10)|Beach Milkshake]]>><<pass 10>><<set $milkshake -= 1>><<stress -5>><</link>><<lstress>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $popcorn gte 1 and $exposed lte 0>>
				<<foodicon "popcorn">><<link [[Eat your popcorn (0:10)|Balloon Consume]]>><<pass 10>><<set $popcorn -= 1>><<wearProp "popcorn">><<trauma -3>><<set $phase to "park">><</link>><<ltrauma>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if Time.dayState is "night" and !Weather.isFrozen("fountain") and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 4) and $daily.ex.fountain is undefined>>
			<<parkicon "fountain">><<link [[Bathe in the fountain (0:10)|Park Fountain]]>><<set $daily.ex.fountain to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist4>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $exposed gte 1 and Time.dayState isnot "night">>
			<<icon "crate.png">><<link [[Hide in a crate (0:10)|Crate Ex]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<if $exposed gte 2 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
				<<icon "flyover.png">><<link [[Cross flyover to the industrial district (0:05)|Flyover Ex Naked]]>><</link>><<if $daily.ex.flyover is undefined>><<exhibitionist5>><</if>>
			<<elseif $exposed is 1 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
				<<icon "flyover.png">><<link [[Cross flyover to the industrial district (0:05)|Flyover Ex Undies]]>><</link>><<if $daily.ex.flyover is undefined>><<exhibitionist3>><</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<add_link "Travel<br>">><<hideDisplay>>
			<<high>>
			<<starfish>>
			<<oxford>>
			<<nightingale>>
			<<loiter>>
		<</if>>
		<<add_link "<br>Alternate routes<br>">>
		<<if $exposed gte 1 and Time.dayState isnot "night">><<hideDisplay>>
		<<else>>
			<<commercial>>
			<<industrial>>
		<</if>>
		<<stormdrain>>
		<<if $historytrait gte 1 and $parktunnelintro gte 1>>
			<<if $schoolBlocked>>
				/* none */
			<<else>>
				<<add_link "<<schoolicon 'courtyard'>><<link [[Secret tunnel to rear school courtyard (0:05)|School Rear Courtyard]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>">>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<displayLinks>>
		<<if $options.mapTop isnot true>>
			<br>
			<<map "park">>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

:: Park Tulip
<<effects>><<wearProp "tulip basket">>

You walk through the tulips, searching for any that are seeding and careful not to tread on the blossoms.
<br><br>

<span class="gold">You can now grow <<foodstufficon "tulip">> tulips.</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Tulip Pick
<<effects>>

You search the riverbank for the prettiest <<foodstufficon "tulip">> tulips, the ones someone might be willing to pay for. These aren't strictly wild flowers. You try to avoid being seen.
<br><br>

<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<wearProp "tulip basket">>
	<span class="green">You find some particularly vibrant specimens.</span>
	<<tending_pick tulip>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	You find some nice specimens, <span class="red">but rip them from the earth with too little care,</span> leaving them haggard and wilted.<<gtending>><<tending 2>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $rng gte 91>>
	<<wearProp "soft drink">>
	You search behind an old wall by the river. There are no tulips. Instead you find two empty cans of soda, an empty packet of crisps, and hundreds of used lottery tickets.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin
<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>

You approach the pumpkin carving tables. Most seats are occupied, with <<people>> hard at work, covering the grass with orange vegetable bits.
<br><br>

<<if !$halloween_pumpkin>>
	<<set $halloween_pumpkin to 1>>
	<<set $halloween_pumpkins_bought to 0>>
	<<set $pumpkin_carving to 0>>
	<<set $pumpkin_carving_knowledge to []>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	"Come to practise for the competition?" asks a smiling <<person>>. "All are welcome, but I'm afraid you'll have to bring your own pumpkins. There's a bit of a shortage. We'll provide a pumpkin for the competition itself, as well as <span class="gold">£1000</span> for the winner. <span class="gold">It's on the 30th.</span> That way we can display the jack-o'-lanterns for Halloween proper."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> turns away, distracted by a mishap.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	"If it's a pumpkin you need," says another voice. "I've got one here you can have for <span class="gold">£100</span>." <<He>> throws a pumpkin straight up, catches it, then explores your body with lascivious eyes. "Or if that's too rich for you, we could put your mouth to work." <<He>> makes a crude gesture with <<his>> tongue.
	<br><br>
	<<if $money gte 10000>>
		<<link [[Buy pumpkin|Park Pumpkin Buy]]>><<money -10000>><<set $halloween_pumpkins_bought += 1>><<tending_give "pumpkin" 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Give oral in return for a pumpkin|Park Pumpkin Oral]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<insufficientStat "promiscuity" "to take up such an alternative!">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Grab the pumpkin and run|Park Pumpkin Athletics]]>><<crimeUp 3 "petty">><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>><<gcrime "petty">>
	<br>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>>
	<<link [[Steal a pumpkin (0:05)|Park Pumpkin Skulduggery]]>><<crimeUp 3 "petty">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<gcrime "petty">>
	<br>
	<<link [[Walk away|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>

	<<if _kylarLocation.area is "park" and !$halloween_pumpkin_kylar>>
		You see Kylar watching from behind a tree.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if $foodstuff.pumpkin.amount gte 1 and $pumpkin_carving lt 10>>
		<<link [[Practice pumpkin carving (1:00)|Park Pumpkin Practise]]>><<pass 60>><<tending_give "pumpkin" -1>><<set $pumpkin_carving += 1>><</link>> | Pumpkins: <<print $foodstuff.pumpkin.amount>>
	<<elseif $pumpkin_carving gte 10>>
		<span class="lblue">You've had all the pumpkin carving practise you need.</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">You have no pumpkins in which to carve.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ask how to get better at pumpkin carving|Park Pumpkin Ask]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Find a pumpkin seller (0:10)|Park Pumpkin Seller]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if _kylarLocation.area is "park" and !$halloween_pumpkin_kylar>>
		<<link [[Call Kylar over|Park Pumpkin Kylar]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Park Pumpkin Ask
<<effects>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
You approach a seasoned-looking carver, and ask if <<he>> has any tips. <<He>> thrusts <<his>> knife into the table, drawing an irritated look from an organiser, and strokes <<his>> chin.
<br><br>

"You won't get my secrets," <<he>> says with a wry smile. "But I can give general advice. There are probably books in the library that will teach you a thing or two. At the end of the day though, there's no substituting practice. So get practising."
<br><br>

<<He>> picks up <<his>> knife, and carves away.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Seller
<<effects>>
<<if $halloween_pumpkins_bought is undefined>><<set $halloween_pumpkins_bought to 0>><</if>>
<<set _pumpkin_price to Math.clamp((10000 + ($halloween_pumpkins_bought * 10000)), 10000, 100000)>>

<<generate1>><<person1>>
You find a <<person>>, throwing and catching a pumpkin like a ball, while trying to sell it to passersby.
<br><br>

"Need a pumpkin, <<girl>>?" <<he>> asks. "The going rate is <<printmoney _pumpkin_price>>." <<He>> leers at your body. "Though if that's too rich for you, you could put your mouth to work instead." <<He>> makes a crude gesture with <<his>> mouth.
<br><br>

<<if $money gte _pumpkin_price>>
	<<link [[Buy a pumpkin (<<printmoney _pumpkin_price>>)|Park Pumpkin Buy]]>><<money `-_pumpkin_price`>><<tending_give "pumpkin" 1>><<set $halloween_pumpkins_bought += 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">You can't afford a pumpkin.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
	<<link [[Give oral in return for a pumpkin|Park Pumpkin Oral]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<insufficientStat "promiscuity" "to take up such an alternative!">>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Grab the pumpkin and run|Park Pumpkin Athletics]]>><<crimeUp 3 "petty">><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>><<gcrime "petty">>
<br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 600>>
<<link [[Steal a pumpkin (0:05)|Park Pumpkin Skulduggery]]>><<pass 5>><<crimeUp 3 "petty">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<gcrime "petty">>
<br>
<<link [[Walk away|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
