<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	You walk away, but keep watch on the <<person>> from nearby. <<He>> tries to sell the pumpkin to others, still throwing and catching it from time to time.
	<br><br>

	A few minutes later <<he>> stops under a low hanging tree. Time to strike. You approach while <<his>> back is turned, clamber up the tree, and wait in the branches above.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> throws the pumpkin in the air again. <span class="green">You snatch it, and slip down the tree, out of sight.</span> You glimpse <<him>> staring at the sky in confusion as you vanish behind some low bushes.
	<br><br>
	<<tending_give "pumpkin" 1>><<wearProp "pumpkin">>
	<<skulduggeryuse>>

	<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
