<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>

You take a seat at the pumpkin carving table, and get to work, carving away while watching the approach of other people up and down the table.
<br><br>

<<if _kylarLocation.area is "park" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "win">>
	You feel Kylar's eyes on you the whole time, watching you across the park.
	<br><br>
<<elseif _kylarLocation.area is "park" and $halloween_pumpkin_kylar is "kylar">>
	Kylar sits beside you, outputting jack-o'-lantern after jack-o'-lantern at tremendous speed. Most are bad, but the sheer volume astounds onlookers.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Practice Progress: <<print ($pumpkin_carving * 10)>>%
<br><br>

<<set _pumpkin_carving to ($pumpkin_carving + ($pumpkin_carving_knowledge?.length * 5))>>

<<pumpkin_prop>>

