<<else>>
	You take your seat alongside the other competitors. 
<</if>>
A crowd gathers to watch, and a <<person>> dressed in a smart outfit steps onto a raised platform. <<He>> taps the microphone.
<br><br>

"Welcome to the annual Halloween pumpkin carving competition," <<he>> says. You hear <<his>> voice repeated through speakers in other parts of the park. <<He>> glances at <<his>> watch. "Without further ado, on the count of three. One. Two."
<br>
<<He>> raises <<his>> arms to encourage the crowd to join in.
<br>
"Three!"
<br><br>

<<link [[Begin|Park Pumpkin Competition 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition 2
<<effects>><<set _kylarLocation to getKylarLocation()>>

