:: Park Pumpkin Competition Won
<<effects>>
<<person1>>
<<earnFeat "Pumpkin Master">>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
<<set $halloween_pumpkin_competition to "won">>
The judge reaches the end of the tables, then turns and walks the way <<he>> came. <<He>> scoops up your jack-o'-lantern, and lifts it above <<his>> head. <span class="green">"We have our winner!"</span><<ggcontrol>><<lltrauma>><<llstress>><<control 25>><<trauma -12>><<stress -12>><<famebusiness 30>>
<br><br>

A great cheer rises, followed by applause, though you notice a few of the other contestants casting jealous glances your way. The <<person>> ushers you up front to pose for a photograph, and makes a show of handing you your prize.
<br><br>

<span class="gold">You've made <<moneyGain 1000>>.</span>
<br><br>

A crowd gathers around you.
<br><br>
"Your pumpkin is wonderful."
<br>
"What's your secret?"
<br>
"Is there a trick to it? Mine looks like a mauled potato."
<br><br>
What do you tell them?
<br><br>

<<link [[Be coy, and keep your secrets close|Park Pumpkin Competition Coy]]>><</link>>
