:: Park Pumpkin Competition Coy
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You give nothing away. People badger you for a while, but respect your silence in the end. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

