<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You tell people it's about practice. They nod along with your words, but some seem disappointed there's no trick to it. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
<br>

:: Park Pumpkin Competition Library
<<effects>>
<<pumpkin_prop>>
You tell people to seek wisdom about the subject in books, and say you got pumpkin carving tips from the school library. Some are satisfied, though others don't seem keen on reading at all. The crowd clears as people arrive to clean up the mess, and make sure all the knives are accounted for.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<unset $pumpkin_win_chance>><</link>>
