The judge reaches the end of the tables, then turns and walks the way <<he>> came. <span class="blue"><<He>> stops before reaching you.</span> Both arms reach out, and <<he>> scoops a wild-eyed Kylar up and away from <<person3>><<his>> jack-o'-lantern.
<br><br>

The crowd hushes as everyone beholds Kylar's work. It's unmistakable. The pumpkin is carved in your likeness. Your face flushes.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>

"Our winner," the <<person1>><<person>> announces. <<He>> seems to consider holding Kylar in the air, but decides against it, placing <<person3>><<him>> down beside <<his>> work.
<br><br>

